OL,3,GNEWSATwo arrested after woman killed in
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA VW Golf, also driving away from
OL,7,FQueensbury, was also damaged in the
OL,8,Fincident at 10:45 BST, which resulted
OL,9,Fin three people being taken to hospital
OL,10,Fwith serious injuries.
OL,12,FWest Yorkshire Police asked anyone who
OL,13,Fsaw the crash, which happened north of
OL,14,Fthe Howcans Lane junction, or the
OL,15,Fmoments leading up to it to get in
OL,16,Ftouch.
